<title>USA: CalPERS announces board appointment.</title>
<headline>CalPERS announces board appointment.</headline>
<dateline>SACRAMENTO, Calif. 1997-03-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>The California Public Employees' Retirement System (CalPERS) on Friday said Joseph Thomas was appointed to serve on the pension fund's 13-member Board of Administration.</p>
<p>Thomas currently serves as director of the Best Life Assurance Company of Irvine, California.</p>
<p>CalPERS is the largest public pension system in the United States with more than $100 billion in assets.</p>
